   - Apply `{ "vibe.hitAmount":"loud", "vibe.hitTailLow":"3" }`.
   - Expect `getHitShape().amount` to be `0.6` (unreadable keeps the field), `.tail.low` to be `3` (readable field updates), and `.knee` to be `HIT_KNEE_DEFAULT` (1; absent resets).
