## Verification commands

- `npm run typecheck`
- `npx vitest run tests/syncedBadText.test.ts tests/perSceneReload.test.ts tests/outputSync.test.ts tests/syncedScope.test.ts tests/roomLookE2E.test.ts tests/roomStorage.test.ts tests/sceneSettings.test.ts tests/autoTune.test.ts tests/driveStore.test.ts tests/bandSplit.test.ts tests/hitStrength.test.ts tests/silenceGate.test.ts`
